  ('air-and-style--2016-a', 'air-and-style--2016-a', 'Opel Air + Style Innsbruck 2016', 'air-and-style', 2016, '2016', NULL, 'contest', 'First year at Olympiaworld rather than in the Bergisel stadium (Onboard''s report places the arena in an open car park beside the Bergisel). Strong valley winds forced organisers to cancel the rounds after round two and to score the podium from the three highest combined round-two scores. Collective reports 2016 as the first year women competed at Innsbruck; Method Mag says the first women''s field at Innsbruck was 2017. Shaun White announced during the event that the tour would expand to five stops. Exact dates not found in a source I opened.', 'unverified', 'held', NULL, 'year', 'Olympiaworld Innsbruck', 'Innsbruck', 'Austria', ARRAY['big-air']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.innsbruck.info/blog/en/events/air-and-style2016/','https://onboardmag.com/news/snowboarding-events/bad-wind-airs-tyle-innsbruck-2016-report-gallery.html','https://collectivemag.de/air-style-vom-bergisel-stadion-in-die-ganze-welt-pid16548/']::text[], 'likely'),
  ('air-and-style--2016-b', 'air-and-style--2016-b', 'Air + Style Los Angeles 2016', 'air-and-style', 2016, '2016-02-20', '2016-02-21', 'contest', 'Second LA edition, moved from the Rose Bowl to Exposition Park next to the LA Coliseum; 16-storey big air jump plus two music stages.', 'verified', 'held', NULL, 'day', 'Exposition Park', 'Los Angeles', 'United States', ARRAY['big-air']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.welikela.com/air-style-festival-2016/']::text[], 'verified'),
  ('air-and-style--2017-a', 'air-and-style--2017-a', 'Air + Style Innsbruck-Tirol 2017', 'air-and-style', 2017, '2017-02', NULL, 'contest', 'Method Mag calls this the 34th edition and says it was the first year women competed in the Air + Style big air, with 30 men and 8 women plus 16 live music acts over two days. Tiroler Tageszeitung reports the Air+Style contest''s history ended in 2017 in the Olympiaworld car park. Edition numbering here (34th) is inconsistent with Wikipedia''s numbering (25th for Beijing 2013).', 'unverified', 'held', NULL, 'month', 'Olympiaworld Innsbruck', 'Innsbruck', 'Austria', ARRAY['big-air']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.methodmag.com/news/air-style-festival-innsbruck-tirol-2017.html','https://www.tt.com/artikel/16237751/das-erbe-des-air-style-snowboarder-fliegen-wieder-auf-bergisel-ab']::text[], 'likely'),
  ('air-and-style--2017-b', 'air-and-style--2017-b', 'Air + Style Beijing 2017', 'air-and-style', 2017, '2017-02', NULL, 'contest', 'Reported by Sport1 in February 2017; exact dates and venue not stated in the page I opened. [v0.2 flag: the row carries a February 2017 date but the German source dates the Beijing edition 25 November 2017. Unresolved.]', 'unverified', 'held', NULL, 'month', NULL, 'Beijing', 'China', ARRAY['big-air']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.sport1.de/actionsport/2017/02/air-style-beijing-2017-anna-gasser-and-mark-mcmorris-holen-den-sieg']::text[], 'likely'),
