  ('burton-rail-days--2015', 'burton-rail-days--2015', '5th Burton Rail Days (2015)', 'burton-rail-days', 2015, '2015-10-26', '2015-10-26', 'contest', 'Fifth edition. Urban street course built from a reported 120 tons of snow in central Tokyo, with a USD 27,000 grand prize and a free kids'' snowboard park alongside. Riders included Yuma Abe, Yuki Kadono, Ryusei Takahashi, Frank April, Zach Aller and Kas Lemmens. Being an October event it belongs to the 2015/16 season.', 'unverified', 'held', NULL, 'day', 'Roppongi Hills', 'Tokyo', 'Japan', ARRAY['rail-jam','jib']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.timeout.com/tokyo/things-to-do/burton-rail-days']::text[], 'likely'),
