  ('mt-baker-legendary-banked-slalom--1985', 'mt-baker-legendary-banked-slalom--1985', '1985 Legendary Banked Slalom', 'es1', 1985, '1985-01', '1985-01', 'contest', 'First edition. Sources disagree on the field size (14 riders per Wikipedia, 16 per Unofficial Networks) and on the date: Mount Baker Experience says February 1985, while Unofficial Networks says the race was deliberately scheduled for Super Bowl Sunday. Tom Sims won; Terry Kidwell 2nd, Ken Achenbach 3rd, Craig Kelly 4th per Mount Baker Experience. Course of roughly 500 feet with 15 gates.', 'verified', 'held', NULL, 'month', 'Mt. Baker Ski Area', 'Deming, Washington', 'USA', ARRAY['banked-slalom']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.mountbakerexperience.com/stories/30-years-of-the-legendary-banked-slalom,339','https://unofficialnetworks.com/2024/01/30/legendary-banked-slalom-history/','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mt._Baker_Legendary_Banked_Slalom','https://lbs.mtbaker.us/results/honor-roll/','https://www.snowboarder.com/news/snowboard-history-timeline-part-21980s','https://snowboarding8090.com/mt-baker-lbs/','https://localfreshies.com/mt-baker-banked-slalom/']::text[], 'verified'),
