  ('mt-baker-legendary-banked-slalom--1991', 'mt-baker-legendary-banked-slalom--1991', '1991 Legendary Banked Slalom', 'es1', 1991, '1991', NULL, 'contest', 'Held year inferred: the organiser''s Honor Roll covers 1985-2025 and the edition numbering chain (2016 = 30th, 2023 = 35th, 2025 = 36th) requires every year from 1985-2004, 2006-2014 and 2016 to have been run. One automated read of the Honor Roll flagged 1991 as possibly having no entries; not independently confirmed.', 'unverified', 'held', NULL, 'year', 'Mt. Baker Ski Area', 'Deming, Washington', 'USA', ARRAY['banked-slalom']::text[], ARRAY['https://lbs.mtbaker.us/results/honor-roll/']::text[], 'likely'),
