  ('oneill-evolution--2009', 'oneill-evolution--2009', 'O''Neill Evolution 2009', 'oneill-evolution', 2009, '2009', NULL, 'contest', 'Inferred from World Snowboard Guide''s ''eight years since its 2006 launch''; no per-year source opened. A worldsnowboarding.org event page for O''Neill Evolution 2009 exists in search indexes but now returns 404.', 'unverified', 'held', NULL, 'year', 'Davos', 'Davos', 'Switzerland', NULL, ARRAY['https://www.worldsnowboardguide.com/news/no-o-neill-evolution-in-davos-this-season.html']::text[], 'likely'),
