  ('zillertal-valley-ralley--2025', 'zillertal-valley-ralley--2025', 'Zillertal Vaelley Raelley 2025/26 (13th season)', 'zillertal-valley-ralley', 2025, '2025-12-20', '2026-04-26', 'contest', '13th season, four stops: Hochzillertal-Kaltenbach (20-21 Dec 2025); Action-Park Kreuzwiese, Zillertal Arena (24-25 Jan 2026); PenkenPark Mayrhofen (28 Feb - 1 Mar 2026); Betterpark Hintertux, Hintertux Glacier (25-26 Apr 2026). Results count for the World Snowboard Points List and the World Rookie Ranking. The 2024/25 season was the 12th and also had four events.', 'verified', 'held', NULL, 'day', NULL, 'Zillertal, Tirol', 'Austria', ARRAY['slopestyle']::text[], ARRAY['https://www.worldsnowboardfederation.org/zillertal-valley-ralley-announces-new-tour-dates-for-2025-2026/']::text[], 'verified')
